    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -460,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The first thing to do after training: load the checkpoint and look past the single accuracy number. A small MLP trains on 75% of the digits for 8 epochs and CheckpointSaver writes digits-mlp.pt; CheckpointLoader reads it back and Inference predicts the 450 test images. The script builds the confusion matrix (rows are the true digit). Accuracy is 0.956, but it is not even: the weakest digit is 8 (0.837), and the most common mistake is 8 read as 1 (3 times).\n\n訓練完的第一件事：載入 checkpoint，不要只看一個正確率。一個小 MLP 用 75% 的數字訓練 8 個 epoch，CheckpointSaver 寫出 digits-mlp.pt；CheckpointLoader 讀回來，Inference 預測 450 張測試影像。腳本建立混淆矩陣（列是真實數字）。正確率是 0.956，但並不平均：最弱的是數字 8 (0.837)，最常見的錯誤是 8 被認成 1（3 次）。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-load",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 2880,
        "y": -180
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Here the loader takes its model from CheckpointSaver's pass-through output so it runs after the file is written. To evaluate a checkpoint from an earlier run, wire a fresh SequentialModel with the same layers into CheckpointLoader instead.\n\n這裡 loader 從 CheckpointSaver 的 pass-through 輸出取得模型，所以會在檔案寫完之後才執行。要評估之前某次執行留下的 checkpoint，改接一個層設定相同的全新 SequentialModel 到 CheckpointLoader 即可。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "load",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -440
        },
        "noteWidth": 320
      }
    }
